Welcome to the BHK Lab!

I=92ll be introducing you to the lab specific onboarding where you will be =
detailed on lab aids, resources etc.

Onboarding Form
Start by filling out the BHKLab Onboarding Form<https://urldefense.com/v3/_=
_https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSem1WRpvKiHyeMop-sOsRx7NOd0hWbT2P=
GRRxiz3nfR3GUPEQ/viewform?usp=3Dsf_link__;!!CjcC7IQ!JozPpKQ11REKhQul5PbKIVq=
YLnX-N5IlePlebem4thE_ziyhGdHf20sU0kCaAbdwWB-zP9LWSICUhlqvqY9w23S2TclgdcP2h1=
o$> =96 this will include setting up some accounts you=92ll use for access =
to lab documents, calendars, etc. Let me know when this is complete so I ca=
n start adding you to our communication channels.

You can then review our complete Lab Onboarding Policy<https://urldefense.c=
om/v3/__https://bhklab.github.io/handbook/dev/onboarding_offboarding/Onboar=
ding/__;!!CjcC7IQ!JozPpKQ11REKhQul5PbKIVqYLnX-N5IlePlebem4thE_ziyhGdHf20sU0=
kCaAbdwWB-zP9LWSICUhlqvqY9w23S2Tclg4ZbCUk8$> at the BHKLab Handbook site fo=
r detailed instructions of lab onboarding. You=92ve completed the UHN secti=
on, you=92ll just need to pick up your photo ID and PMCRT access card on yo=
ur first day on-site.

Work site
The lab is currently working on-site on Tuesday & Wednesdays + one addition=
al day (other days are flexible) and your attendance is mandatory. You are =
assigned on-site workspace [insert lab space] when you come in. Please see =
the Workspace Map here<https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://bhklab.github.io=
/handbook/dev/General/Lab_Space/*lab-workspace__;Iw!!CjcC7IQ!JozPpKQ11REKhQ=
ul5PbKIVqYLnX-N5IlePlebem4thE_ziyhGdHf20sU0kCaAbdwWB-zP9LWSICUhlqvqY9w23S2T=
clg15ECNJs$>, the workspace is labelled the same. Please bring your laptop =
when you go to the lab for the first time.

Orientation Meeting
Please let me know of your availability for Wednesday, July 22nd @ 10:30am =
for your orientation meeting (should be an hour at most).

And let me know if you have any questions!

--_000_YT1PR01MB404213ABD270B6AC29286D08F3AF2YT1PR01MB4042CANP_
